WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Both driven wheels connect through the differential.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Small gears allow the axle speeds to differ.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
The outside wheel travels a longer path in a turn.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
This is a simplified open-differential diagram.
